  "$comment": "DEV_OS Engine catalogue (E18). Types, the stacks the method can run, each with its toolchain, its manifest file and the commands of its checks, modules with providers, and the documents worth preparing. A provider with method names the DEV_OS module or variable it turns on; its keys come from devos/setup.json. A provider with env lists the keys the app reads. Each stack's scaffold is the recipe of fence T01 (PR-49): the generator commands, the health route (empty: none), the logger, the test runner and the one architecture rule its test proves. A stack that serves a web interface has preview: the command that serves its production build for the runner's captures ({port} is replaced and PORT is set, PR-51).",
